      <Value><![CDATA[Website: antoantaichinh.vn
Trang mạng xã hội: chưa có. Khi có, địa chỉ sẽ được công bố tại đây.]]></Value>
    </channels>
    <channelsTitle>
      <Value><![CDATA[Kênh chính thức của website]]></Value>
    </channelsTitle>
    <checkText>
      <Value><![CDATA[{
  "blocks": {
    "contentData": [],
    "settingsData": [],
    "expose": [],
    "layout": {}
  },
  "markup": "\u003Cp\u003ECh\u1EA1m v\u00E0o thanh \u0111\u1ECBa ch\u1EC9 \u1EDF tr\u00EAn c\u00F9ng tr\u00ECnh duy\u1EC7t. Ph\u1EA7n ch\u1EEF ngay tr\u01B0\u1EDBc d\u1EA5u g\u1EA1ch ch\u00E9o \u0111\u1EA7u ti\u00EAn ph\u1EA3i \u0111\u00FAng l\u00E0 \u003Cstrong\u003Eantoantaichinh.vn\u003C/strong\u003E, kh\u00F4ng th\u1EEBa, kh\u00F4ng thi\u1EBFu m\u1ED9t ch\u1EEF n\u00E0o. \u0110\u1EEBng tin bi\u1EC3u t\u01B0\u1EE3ng, m\u00E0u s\u1EAFc, h\u00ECnh \u1ED5 kh\u00F3a hay vi\u1EC7c trang n\u1EB1m \u0111\u1EA7u k\u1EBFt qu\u1EA3 t\u00ECm ki\u1EBFm; nh\u1EEFng th\u1EE9 \u0111\u00F3 \u0111\u1EC1u l\u00E0m gi\u1EA3 ho\u1EB7c mua \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c.\u003C/p\u003E"
}]]></Value>
    </checkText>
    <checkTitle>
      <Value><![CDATA[Cách tự kiểm tra]]></Value>
    </checkTitle>
    <hideFromSearch>
      <Value><![CDATA[]]></Value>
    </hideFromSearch>
    <intro>
      <Value><![CDATA[{
  "blocks": {
    "contentData": [],
    "settingsData": [],
    "expose": [],
    "layout": {}
  },
  "markup": "\u003Cp\u003ECh\u00FAng t\u00F4i kh\u00F4ng c\u00F3 website n\u00E0o kh\u00E1c, kh\u00F4ng c\u00F3 \u1EE9ng d\u1EE5ng cho \u0111i\u1EC7n tho\u1EA1i, v\u00E0 kh\u00F4ng c\u00F3 trang m\u1EA1ng x\u00E3 h\u1ED9i n\u00E0o ngo\u00E0i nh\u1EEFng \u0111\u1ECBa ch\u1EC9 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c c\u00F4ng b\u1ED1 t\u1EA1i \u0111\u00E2y. M\u1ECDi \u0111\u1ECBa ch\u1EC9 kh\u00E1c, d\u00F9 ch\u1EC9 kh\u00E1c m\u1ED9t ch\u1EEF c\u00E1i hay kh\u00E1c ph\u1EA7n \u0111u\u00F4i nh\u01B0 .com, .net, .org, .info, \u0111\u1EC1u kh\u00F4ng ph\u1EA3i website n\u00E0y.\u003C/p\u003E"
}]]></Value>
    </intro>
    <lead>
      <Value><![CDATA[Website chống lừa đảo là mục tiêu bị làm giả hàng đầu. Mất một phút kiểm tra là đủ.]]></Value>
    </lead>
